{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"wiki-solo-r4--gemma31","runHash":"3cff6921","audio":"../../audio/narration/wiki-solo-r4--gemma31.5b7b8332.mp3","audioBytes":251472,"durationMs":83690,"runEndMs":44097,"timeMap":[[0,0],[14690,14690],[23527,14690],[28870,19460],[29220,19760],[29920,19760],[39183,29023],[48852,29023],[49202,29025],[49902,29025],[52060,31183],[53625,43697],[54025,44097],[83690,44097]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":5983,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one Gemma 4 31B agent today, alone with a shared wiki."},{"audioMs":6333,"endMs":9417,"runMs":6333,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":9767,"endMs":14340,"runMs":9767,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":14690,"endMs":17159,"runMs":14690,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo_b","text":"I want to see if the wiki keeps pulling it back."},{"audioMs":17509,"endMs":23177,"runMs":14690,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto.b","text":"Dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":23527,"endMs":28870,"runMs":14690,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":29920,"endMs":33561,"runMs":19760,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.c","text":"Agent 0 is on the wiki. First visit of the run."},{"audioMs":39883,"endMs":43686,"runMs":29023,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve","text":"Agent 0 solves the task, in 25 steps."},{"audioMs":44036,"endMs":45378,"runMs":29023,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.b","text":"How do you read that one?"},{"audioMs":45728,"endMs":48852,"runMs":29023,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.c","text":"And the clock is its own now. Watch what it does next."},{"audioMs":49902,"endMs":51310,"runMs":29025,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":54025,"endMs":60294,"runMs":44097,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.agentShare","text":"Agent 0 is done. After first contact, about 10 percent of its steps went to the board."},{"audioMs":60644,"endMs":64832,"runMs":44097,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.casual.b","text":"One visit, maybe two, and gone. Not much pull there."},{"audioMs":65182,"endMs":71658,"runMs":44097,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":72008,"endMs":78663,"runMs":44097,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":79013,"endMs":80156,"runMs":44097,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":80506,"endMs":81489,"runMs":44097,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":3}}
